<title>USA: COREStaff authorizes 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>COREStaff authorizes 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>COREStaff Inc, a provider of temporary and contract staffing, said on Wednesday that it authorized a three-for-two stock split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The split will be effected in the form of a stock dividend, payable on September 20 to stockholders of record on September 10.</p>
<p>The stock split will increase the number of outstanding shares of the company from about 20.8 million to 31.2 million.</p>
</text>
